  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.18,
      "e": 3.21,
      "text": "^- A request came in from Texas"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.21,
      "e": 4.57,
      "text": "^through the National Guard Bureau,"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.57,
      "e": 6.41,
      "text": "^it was looking for helicopter assets,"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.41,
      "e": 9.18,
      "text": "specifically with hoist capability to go down there"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.18,
      "e": 12.05,
      "text": "and support the domestic operation currently happening"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.05,
      "e": 15.39,
      "text": "after the aftermath of Hurricane Harvey."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.51,
      "e": 18.26,
      "text": "So Jersey has answered that call,"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.87,
      "e": 21.59,
      "text": "and we're sending down a joint team of,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.59,
      "e": 23.58,
      "text": "from the 50th Helicopter Assault Battalion"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.58,
      "e": 26.18,
      "text": "and the 227 ASOS, so the ASOS members working"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.18,
      "e": 29.03,
      "text": "as the rescue technicians are going down to hoist,"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.03,
      "e": 32.18,
      "text": "and working closely with the aviation crew"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.18,
      "e": 34.85,
      "text": "that we've been training with for the past couple"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.85,
      "e": 37.06,
      "text": "of years now, so we have a great working relationship"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.06,
      "e": 40.53,
      "text": "and we're hoping to see if we can do some good down there."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.53,
      "e": 43.95,
      "text": "(slow orchestral music)"
    }
  ],
